'''Sengoku Wargods Vajiras''' (戦国武神バサラーズ, ''Sengoku Bushin Basarāzu'') is one of the Rare Cat Capsule Event in Battle Cats. This event was implemented in November 29th, 2013 with 3 characters, and is the third Rare Cat Capsule Event. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.9 Update|Version 2.0.9]]. All cats in this set have [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] [[Special Abilities|abilities]].

To unlock this banner in [[The Battle Cats Unite!|The Battle Cats Unite]], the player has to clear [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]] in the '''Japanese''' ('''JP''') and '''International''' ('''WW''') versions and [[Argentina (Empire of Cats)|Argentina]] in the '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') version.

