==Trivia==
*This is the first ever Uber Rare Set to have all 8 units gain a [[True Form]].
*All of the Vajiras are named after actual Samurais/Daimyōs. However, out of all of them, Imagawa Yoshimoto was the only one who would have been Shogun, only to be slain by Oda Nobunga's army while marching to Kyoto.
*Despite [[Uesugi Kenshin (Uber Rare Cat)|Uesugi Kenshin]]'s Evolved Form name appearing as "Wargod Kenshin" in the game, it is named "Warlord Kenshin" in the gacha banner.
*One of the possible endings for [[Gamatoto Expedition]] log messages is "after dueling with a Vajira."

